  "_provenance": [
    "PARTIAL LIST. Transcribed from the terms and conditions printed on Max's own gift-card",
    "leaflets: gc-max-physical.pdf (SharedMedia/11013) and gc-max-digital.pdf",
    "(SharedMedia/11012), both fetched 2026-07-29.",
    "",
    "Max presents its merchant network as a grid of logo IMAGES, so the accepted brands",
    "cannot be read out of the PDF. What is machine-readable is the fine print, which names",
    "the chains carrying a restriction ('no double discounts', 'not in outlet branches',",
    "'up to 50% of the transaction'). Every brand named there IS accepted, so this list is",
    "sound in what it asserts and incomplete in what it omits: a shop missing here may still",
    "take the card. The app flags the list as partial so a miss is never read as a refusal.",
    "",
    "The physical and digital leaflets carry near-identical terms, so one list serves both.",
    "Max states the two networks differ once a physical card is converted to digital, but",
    "that difference is only visible in the logo grids, so it cannot be represented here.",
    "",
    "Online redemption is false throughout: the terms say the card cannot be used on the",
    "chains' websites except where explicitly stated, and the exceptions are in the images.",
    "",
    "The authoritative, current list lives in Max's MYGIFT app and at gift-card.co.il, which",
    "was unreachable at the time of writing and offers no machine-readable endpoint."
  ],
